    <string name="tutorial_point1_desc">Tap the top Master Switch to activate/deactivate the crosshair on top of all games.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_point2_title">2. Reticle Style Carousel</string>
    <string name="tutorial_point2_desc">Tap any reticle shape (Dot, Circle, Cross, Tactical) to switch crosshair geometry instant.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_point3_title">3. Dynamic Color Studio</string>
    <string name="tutorial_point3_desc">Tap the Hex code field or RGB sliders to match crosshair color with target backgrounds.</string>
